Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Jessica Lum attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 62, "text": "**German University Alumna Makes Waves in Research Community**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 64, "end": 302, "text": "Hannover, Germany - In a breakthrough that is sending ripples through the academic world, a researcher from Leibniz University Hannover has made a groundbreaking discovery that promises to revolutionize the field of environmental science."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 303, "end": 484, "text": "Jessica Lum, a 30-year-old researcher who graduated from Leibniz University Hannover in 2015, has been making headlines with her innovative approach to sustainable energy solutions."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 485, "end": 620, "text": "Her latest study, published in the prestigious journal Nature, has sparked widespread interest among scientists and policymakers alike."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 621, "end": 729, "text": "\"I'm thrilled to see my research gaining traction,\" Lum said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 730, "end": 867, "text": "\"As an alumna of Leibniz University Hannover, I'm proud to be contributing to the university's rich legacy of innovation and excellence.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 868, "end": 972, "text": "Lum's research focuses on harnessing the power of microorganisms to convert organic waste into biofuels."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 973, "end": 1108, "text": "Her team's findings suggest that this approach could reduce greenhouse gas emissions by up to 70% compared to traditional fossil fuels."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1109, "end": 1153, "text": "\"Jessica's work is a